    "text": "Consider following reactions:<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7c945b0d-d236-4fe5-ae4c-4ddb3ff8e1a4.png\" style=\"width:2.83333in;height:1.07986in\" /><br />\rThe sum of molecular masses of gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is ____________ <math><mi>u</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
